[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15121.269, "timestamp": "04:12:01", "text": "当我们玩《军团要塞》的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15123.03, "timestamp": "04:12:03", "text": "2 个模组？对，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15125.11, "timestamp": "04:12:05", "text": "不过，万事开头难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15127.269, "timestamp": "04:12:07", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15131.349, "timestamp": "04:12:11", "text": "对我来说，开头更有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15133.189, "timestamp": "04:12:13", "text": "因为一旦你玩得太深入，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15135.75, "timestamp": "04:12:15", "text": "这有点让人厌烦。这取决于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15138.229, "timestamp": "04:12:18", "text": "关于人民。我猜有些人……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15140.309, "timestamp": "04:12:20", "text": "这真的取决于人们如何看待事物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15143.269, "timestamp": "04:12:23", "text": "观看比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15145.11, "timestamp": "04:12:25", "text": "我更喜欢游戏初期阶段，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15147.11, "timestamp": "04:12:27", "text": "那是我们唯一活跃的时间段。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15148.79, "timestamp": "04:12:28", "text": "因为当你把所有东西都建成巨型基地时，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15151.11, "timestamp": "04:12:31", "text": "真是无聊透顶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15153.91, "timestamp": "04:12:33", "text": "呃，我选择尽可能少地学习。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15156.95, "timestamp": "04:12:36", "text": "这款游戏有可能。那真是个该死的家伙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15158.55, "timestamp": "04:12:38", "text": "别把时间浪费在这个游戏上。他妈的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15161.59, "timestamp": "04:12:41", "text": "这款游戏。那样的话，当我……的时候就很有趣了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15165.349, "timestamp": "04:12:45", "text": "在线观看。乔，你在做什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15167.269, "timestamp": "04:12:47", "text": "来点什么吧。我不知道。我发现我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15169.67, "timestamp": "04:12:49", "text": "我觉得我找到了一个相对来说像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15173.51, "timestamp": "04:12:53", "text": "我们可以杀害动物吗？是的。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15175.75, "timestamp": "04:12:55", "text": "前提是你没先被杀掉。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15176.95, "timestamp": "04:12:56", "text": "这是真的。如果你没被杀的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15179.67, "timestamp": "04:12:59", "text": "第一的。"}]